{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19238","headline":"詶太原狄尚书见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶太原狄尚书见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家声烜赫冠前贤，时无穹崇镇北边。\n身上官衔如座主，幕中谭笑取同年。\n幽幷侠少趋鞭弭，燕赵佳人奉管弦。\n仍把天兵书号笔，远题长句寄山川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}